<title>UK: S&amp;P affirms Mediocredito Centrale A plus l-term.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P affirms Mediocredito Centrale A plus l-term.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's said on Tuesday it affirmed Mediocredito Centrale SpA's A plus long-term rating and removed it from CreditWatch, where it was placed on December 20, 1996.</p>
<p>The action follows the bank's formal offer for a 60 percent stake in Banco di Napoli, which was put up for auction by the Italian Treasury, S&amp;P said.</p>
<p>&quot;The rating outlook is stable,&quot; S&amp;P said in a statement.</p>
</text>
